OL,3,GNEWSAUK government declines to increase
OL,4,Afinancial help for Stormont
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has declined to increase
OL,7,Fits offer of financial help to the
OL,8,FExecutive beyond what it put on the
OL,9,Ftable two weeks ago, it is understood.
OL,11,FEarlier this month, the Secretary of
OL,12,FState Sir Chris Bryant made an offer of
OL,13,Fa financial package worth about #1.5bn
OL,14,Fover the next three years - that was a
OL,15,Frise from an initial proposal of
OL,16,F#1.1bn.
OL,18,FBut executive parties said it did not
OL,19,Fgo far enough and have argued that
OL,20,Fsignificant gaps remain before they can
OL,21,Fagree to a deal that would allow them
OL,22,Fto set a budget.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
